Output "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/out/tui-palette.gif"
Source common.tape
Hide
Type ". /var/tmp/sesync-demo/env.sh; rm -f ~/.config/sesync/tui.json; cd ~; clear" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Show
Sleep 400ms
Type "sesync --tui" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Ctrl+P Sleep 1.5s
Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 350ms Down Sleep 1s
Type "team" Sleep 2s
Backspace 4 Sleep 500ms
Type "scheme" Sleep 1.2s Enter Sleep 1.5s
Down Sleep 1.3s Down Sleep 1.3s Down Sleep 1.3s Down Sleep 1.3s Down Sleep 1.3s Down Sleep 1.3s
Enter Sleep 2s
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
